"quests.unlock":["Conclua “Além do berçário” para desbloquear.", "Complete “Beyond the nursery” to unlock.", "「ゆりかごの向こうへ」達成で解放。", "Completa “Más allá del vivero” para desbloquear.", "完成“走出育幼区”后解锁。"],
