"event.relicTitle":["Relicário de nácar aberto", "Nacre reliquary opened", "真珠層の宝箱を開いた", "Relicario de nácar abierto", "已开启珍珠质圣匣"],
"event.relicBody":["Uma peça de {family} e um tecido vivo entraram na sua Bolsa.", "A {family} part and living tissue entered your Bag.", "{family}の器官と生体組織が持ち物に入りました。", "Una pieza de {family} y tejido vivo entraron en tu Bolsa.", "一个{family}部件和活性组织已放入背包。"],
"event.trophyTitle":["Troféu de criatura grande", "Large creature trophy", "大型生物の戦利品", "Trofeo de criatura grande", "大型生物战利品"],
"event.trophyBody":["Sua vitória rendeu uma peça de {family} e três tecidos vivos.", "Your victory yielded a {family} part and three living tissues.", "勝利により{family}の器官と生体組織3つを得ました。", "Tu victoria rindió una pieza de {family} y tres tejidos vivos.", "这场胜利获得了一个{family}部件和三份活性组织。"],
